Output examples/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1100
Set Height 550
Set Padding 25
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Theme "Dracula"

Hide
Type "export PATH=/z/greenlight/.venv/Scripts:$PATH && cd /z/greenlight"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "greenlight tail examples/demo-session.jsonl"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
